# Sulfur Falls: "This land enters tapped unless you control an Island or a Mountain." (CR 614.1c, 614.12a: read on the
# battlefield as it enters, the land itself never counted). Beside a Plains only the first copy enters tapped (turn 3);
# once an Island is out the second enters untapped (turn 7), the positive control for the first. It also taps for {U} or
# {R}: green is refused beside the blue it does add, and the {U} activation is that positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Sulfur Falls
Island
Sulfur Falls
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Sulfur Falls.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Sulfur Falls.Tapped = true
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Sulfur Falls.Activate(Ability: {U} or {R}; Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sulfur Falls.Activate(Ability: {U} or {R}; Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Sulfur Falls.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Sulfur Falls#2.Tapped = false

[Expect]
Turn = 7
Bot1.Battlefield.Sulfur Falls#2.Tapped = false
